{"branch":"하계점","html":"<section id=\"selected-directions\" class=\"km-directions\" aria-labelledby=\"selected-directions-title\" data-km-branch=\"하계점\"><h3 id=\"selected-directions-title\">찾아오시는 길</h3><p class=\"km-intro\">하계점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"km-map\" data-state=\"waiting\"><iframe data-km-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/maps/39t6ac6gziu.htm\" title=\"하계점 카카오 지도\" width=\"800\" height=\"398\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe><p class=\"km-map-status\">카카오 지도</p></div><div class=\"km-details\"><dl><dt>주소</dt><dd>서울 노원구 노원로 257 401호</dd></dl><section class=\"km-transit\"><h4>주변 지하철</h4><ul><li><span class=\"km-line\">수도권 7호선</span>하계역</li><li><span class=\"km-line\">수도권 7호선</span>중계역</li></ul></section><section class=\"km-transit\"><h4>주변 정류장</h4><ul><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">1</span>하계1동주민센터</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">2</span>서울온천</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">3</span>노원경찰서</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">4</span>노원경찰서.혜성여고</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">5</span>골마을근린공원</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">6</span>대진고등학교</li><li><span class=\"km-stop-number\">7</span>시립과학관.한신동성아파트</li></ul></section><section class=\"km-transit\"><h4>주변 버스</h4><ul class=\"km-buses\"><li><span class=\"km-bus-kind\" data-type=\"0101\">간선</span><span class=\"km-route-names\"><span>100</span></span></li><li><span class=\"km-bus-kind\" data-type=\"0102\">지선</span><span class=\"km-route-names\"><span>1132</span><span>1221</span><span>1224</span><span>1141</span></span></li></ul></section><p class=\"km-traffic-note\">주변 교통 정보는 제공된 카카오맵 약도 기준입니다. 노선과 정차 여부는 운행 상황에 따라 달라질 수 있습니다.</p></div></section>"}